hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1856","Ilm ke talab ke bare mein jo kuchh aaya hai us ka bab. Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Luqman Hakeem ne apne bete ko wasiyat ki aur kaha ke aey mere bete ulema ke paas baitho aur apne ghutne un se milao, kyunke Allah dilon ko hikmat ke noor se zinda karta hai jaisa Allah murda zameen ko aasman ki barish se zinda karta hai."
